If you require travel sponsorship (flight, hotel) in order to attend the
Linux Printing summit your

action is required. Please send a mail to John Cherry, Till Kamppeter and/or
myself BEFORE

Friday, March 3 to let us know

1)       that you intent to attend but need sponsorship

2)       the departure location of your flight and estimated cost of your
flight

You must do this even if you have already indicated before that you will
require sponsorship.

Note that their are 35 registrations so far and that there are only 15
places left so also make sure 

to register if you haven't done that yet.

